{"3814490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sweet Nibbles", "steam_appid": 3814490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the twisted world of Mr. Shrine’s candy empire in this action-horror adventure.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight off possessed dolls, solve deadly puzzles, and master movement abilities like wall running to infiltrate a sinister factory built to control the minds of the children. Uncover dark secrets, meet mysterious allies (or enemies), and take the fight to the evil billionaire himself. Can you stop Mr. Shrine before it's too late?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All are a work in progress and offer an in development look at some of the mechanics and systems coming to Sweet Nibbles! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Docks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Docks, where you first step towards taking down Mr Shrine! You gather the atmosphere and feeling of the island that you're about to take on. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814490/extras/975921b51636026f8e7a644b04ceaea1.poster.avif?t=1756820031\" width=620 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814490/extras/975921b51636026f8e7a644b04ceaea1.webm?t=1756820031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814490/extras/975921b51636026f8e7a644b04ceaea1.mp4?t=1756820031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mr Nibbles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is he friend or foe? Watch out because he might have a split personality!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814490/extras/3ff8a8f2800b397b92153ee412b6649d.poster.avif?t=1756820031\" width=620 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814490/extras/3ff8a8f2800b397b92153ee412b6649d.webm?t=1756820031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814490/extras/3ff8a8f2800b397b92153ee412b6649d.mp4?t=1756820031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter multiple puzzles to receive info, gadgets, or intel about the candy factory and Mr Shrine. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814490/extras/de971326ebd3b7f1f219b7e056e620a6.poster.avif?t=1756820031\" width=620 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814490/extras/de971326ebd3b7f1f219b7e056e620a6.webm?t=1756820031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain mag boots that allow you to have more mobility, speed, wall runs, and more!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814490/extras/cbfc7c62a742b58972ff7a083691920e.poster.avif?t=1756820031\" width=620 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814490/extras/cbfc7c62a742b58972ff7a083691920e.webm?t=1756820031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814490/extras/cbfc7c62a742b58972ff7a083691920e.mp4?t=1756820031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dream World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the Dream World to learn more about the lore and solve puzzles you encounter in the game. There are some things you can only see in the Dream World to help you in reality. The Dream World can take you anywhere, and things get weird!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814490/extras/a960b28d2215fdbf1115f840f7ea7812.poster.avif?t=1756820031\" width=620 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814490/extras/a960b28d2215fdbf1115f840f7ea7812.webm?t=1756820031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814490/extras/a960b28d2215fdbf1115f840f7ea7812.mp4?t=1756820031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cabin</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Main Island!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814490/extras/d0301f4f8d338dfe02fb5ee2b18e30d9.poster.avif?t=1756820031\" width=620 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814490/extras/d0301f4f8d338dfe02fb5ee2b18e30d9.webm?t=1756820031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814490/extras/d0301f4f8d338dfe02fb5ee2b18e30d9.mp4?t=1756820031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steam